WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.740
Hi, I'm Opti!

2
00:00:01.760 --> 00:00:04.250
Here's how our Wonder Films lessons work.

3
00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:06.930
First, press Play the film.

4
00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:09.810
When it ends, press Start the lesson.

5
00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:11.130
See the bouncing hand?

6
00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:13.290
It shows you what to tap next.

7
00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:16.620
A word with a dotted line
is a science word.

8
00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:18.650
Tap it to see what it means.

9
00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:21.370
Press my speaker button
to hear me read to you.

10
00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:28.010
Go through the scenes in order: Warm-Up,
The Lesson, Self-Check, and Assignment.

11
00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:31.090
In each activity, do one step at a time.

12
00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:36.010
When you see Next, read what it says first,
then tap Next.

13
00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:38.410
In the Assignment, write your answers.

14
00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:43.770
In Part C, draw and label your picture,
then press Save my drawing.

15
00:00:44.080 --> 00:00:47.850
Copy your answers into Canvas,
and upload your drawing too.

16
00:00:47.920 --> 00:00:50.890
Check off your list,
then premiere your own film.

17
00:00:51.120 --> 00:00:54.120
Lights, camera, science!
